{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"Operator-approved early removal (pre-1.0 breaking pass #3), 2026-08-12. Source: the DEPRECATION REMOVAL-READINESS SURVEY, comment #11 on childsafe-bizarre-lorikeet (b902-18af-14ed-4da1), Tier 1 item 1 — the only genuinely expired, genuinely dead surface found. Operator ruling (verbatim): \"The two best candidates and the one ready now are all approved for removal.\"\n\n## What\n\nDelete the dead `.gitattributes` migration arm that strips the retired `.reconciler-* merge=ours` line from an already-initialized tracker.\n\n## Why it is dead\n\nThe reconciler pass-lock/phase-gate moved onto `refs/reconciler/*` (epic dust-troth-naval / C4), so the union-merge carve-out was retired. This store ALREADY ran the strip: `git log origin/tickets -- .gitattributes` shows exactly two commits, the second being 826d5ae379 \"drop retired .reconciler-* merge=ours\", and the live blob contains only `.bridge_state/* merge=ours`. The arm is permanently unreachable here. Residual risk, accepted by the operator ruling: a clone that has not swept since 2026-07-05 would no longer be converged by `init`.\n\n## Scope (current main)\n\n- `src/rebar/_commands/init.py:69` — the `_RETIRED_GITATTRIBUTES_LINES` constant and its explanatory comment.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/init.py:600-616` — the strip arm at the tail of the gitattributes ensure-unit; the unit then returns `EnsureOutcome(\"gitattributes\", \"ok\", \".gitattributes converged\")` for any existing committed `.gitattributes`.\n- `tests/interfaces/store/test_gitattributes_merge.py:104-116` — `test_gitattributes_migration_strips_retired_reconciler_line`, which exercises only the deleted arm.\n- `tests/interfaces/store/test_ensure_drift_matrix.py:25,88,106` — imports `_RETIRED_GITATTRIBUTES_LINES` and injects \"committed .gitattributes carries the retired line\" as the gitattributes drift; that drift is no longer convergent, so it is retargeted to the drift the surviving create arm still fixes (no committed `.gitattributes` at all).\n\nOut of scope: the gitattributes ensure-unit's create arm (School-B convergent, see `docs/migrations.md`), and the `.bridge_state/* merge=ours` line. No deprecation-registry or tombstone row is involved — this is internal store convergence, not a user-facing input, so it never had one.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] `_RETIRED_GITATTRIBUTES_LINES` and the strip arm are gone from `src/rebar/_commands/init.py`; checked: `grep -rn _RETIRED_GITATTRIBUTES_LINES src tests` returns no matches.\n- [x] The gitattributes ensure-unit returns `ok` / \".gitattributes converged\" for an existing committed `.gitattributes`, and its create arm still writes the `.bridge_state/* merge=ours` block on a fresh tracker; proven by `pytest tests/interfaces/store/test_gitattributes_merge.py`.\n- [x] The drift matrix still converges every ensure unit with the gitattributes drift retargeted; proven by `pytest tests/interfaces/store/test_ensure_drift_matrix.py`.\n- [x] `docs/release-notes.md` carries a \"BREAKING (pre-1.0)\" entry for this removal recording \"operator-approved early removal (pre-1.0 pass #3), 2026-08-12\", following the format of the two prior passes (DE7 and the ticket-5899 sibling pass).\n- [x] Gates are green; checked: `make lint` and `make typecheck` pass.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `pytest tests/interfaces/store/test_gitattributes_merge.py tests/interfaces/store/test_ensure_drift_matrix.py` — the two suites that cover the ensure-unit's create arm and full-drift convergence.\n- `make lint` and `make typecheck` — the commit gate.\n- `grep -rn _RETIRED_GITATTRIBUTES_LINES src tests` — proves the constant is fully gone (the LSP misses string-named references, so this is a raw grep per `docs/code-navigation.md`)."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1786569662103865001,"uuid":"b6779081-b1f0-4b21-88e0-0eab9db04145"}